{"id":"n52757-1-6","stage":2,"title":"띠 · 腰带","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n52757-1-6-1","ko":"바지의 허리 부분이 커서 자꾸 내려가네.","zh":"裤子的腰部分太大了，老是往下掉呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바지의","meaning":"裤子","explanation":"바지：裤子；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"바지","audio":"/audio/fb24dd66a8c8c7dd42d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66249","senseId":"1","lemma":"바지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"허리","meaning":"腰","explanation":"허리：腰","readings":[{"term":"허리","audio":"/audio/777cb8e22269860361d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30201","senseId":"1","lemma":"허리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부분이","meaning":"部分","explanation":"부분：部分；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"부분","audio":"/audio/204cbadbdb5dd2ee0cb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65853","senseId":"1","lemma":"부분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"커서","meaning":"肥，肥大","explanation":"크다：肥，肥大；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"2","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내려가네.","meaning":"下，下去","explanation":"내려가다：下，下去；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"내려가다","audio":"/audio/d27a99abb5cf233cc101.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63723","senseId":"9","lemma":"내려가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fb24dd66a8c8c7dd","term":"바지","zh":"裤子","audio":"/audio/fb24dd66a8c8c7dd42d1.mp3","entryId":"66249","definition":"穿在下身的衣物，上面为筒状，下面是可以放腿的两条分叉。","pronunciation":["바지"]},{"id":"777cb8e222698603","term":"허리","zh":"腰","audio":"/audio/777cb8e22269860361d6.mp3","entryId":"30201","definition":"人或动物身体上从肋骨下方到尾骨的部分。","pronunciation":["허리"]},{"id":"204cbadbdb5dd2ee","term":"부분","zh":"部分","audio":"/audio/204cbadbdb5dd2ee0cb9.mp3","entryId":"65853","definition":"构成整体的小范围；或指把整体分为多个时的其中一个。","pronunciation":["부분"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"肥，肥大","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"鞋子或衣服等大于合身尺码。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"d27a99abb5cf233c","term":"내려가다","zh":"下，下去","audio":"/audio/d27a99abb5cf233cc101.mp3","entryId":"63723","definition":"从某个高处移动到低处。","pronunciation":["내려가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/361f5604cb45031a5ce5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n52757-1-6-2","ko":"허리에 띠를 매면 되잖아.","zh":"在腰上系条腰带不就行了吗。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"허리에","meaning":"腰","explanation":"허리：腰；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"허리","audio":"/audio/777cb8e22269860361d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30201","senseId":"1","lemma":"허리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"띠를","meaning":"腰带","explanation":"띠：腰带；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"띠","audio":"/audio/f2a6782273c776e4938e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52757","senseId":"1","lemma":"띠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"매면","meaning":"打，系","explanation":"매다：打，系；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"매다","audio":"/audio/0341d7416782d5c7f5f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26487","senseId":"2","lemma":"매다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되잖아.","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"777cb8e222698603","term":"허리","zh":"腰","audio":"/audio/777cb8e22269860361d6.mp3","entryId":"30201","definition":"人或动物身体上从肋骨下方到尾骨的部分。","pronunciation":["허리"]},{"id":"f2a6782273c776e4"